Qwt 6.4.0
=========

- support for < Qt 5.6 dropped

  Qt 5.6 is considered as relevant because it is
  the latest version relased un der LGPL V2.

- c++11

  with dropping Qt4 the complete code base could finally
  make use of c++11

- QwtPlotGLCanvas removed

  Use QwtPlotOpenGLCanvas ( using QOpenGLWidget ) instead.
  The code of QwtPlotAbstractGLCanvas has been moved to QwtPlotOpenGLCanvas.
